sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Hybrid extractor
    participant T as HTML strategy
    participant O as OCR strategy
    C->>H: extract(page)
    H->>T: extract(page)
    alt HTML extraction fails
        T-->>H: Throw IOException
        H-->>C: Propagate HTML error
    else HTML extraction succeeds
        T-->>H: HTML text
        H->>O: extract(page)
        alt OCR succeeds
            O-->>H: OCR text
            H-->>C: Labelled HTML and OCR
        else OCR I/O error with eligible fallback
            O-->>H: Throw IOException
            H-->>C: Labelled HTML
        else OCR error under other conditions
            O-->>H: Throw extraction error
            H-->>C: Propagate error
        end
    end
